---
---`GET /orgs/{org}/private-registries/{secret_name}`
---@param input github.private_registries.GetOrgPrivateRegistryRequest
---@return github.private_registries.OrgPrivateRegistryConfiguration? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_org_private_registry(input) end

